Subject: [PATCH v17 16/16] locking: Switch to _irq_{disable,enable}() variants in cleanup guards
Date: Wed, 21 Jan 2026 17:39:19 -0500
Message-ID: <20260121223933.1568682-17-lyude@redhat.com>
In-Reply-To: <20260121223933.1568682-1-lyude@redhat.com>
